# Legend pick + absorption routes (absorb/absorb.js, life/corridor_flow.js Legend branch, design/data/skills.toml
# [legend_pick] / [absorb]). `ttl absorb expect ...` and `ttl registry expect ...` print "ttl: ..." when a value is wrong,
# which `server.sh test-all` counts as a failure. A `ttl absorb simulate` line prints "absorb simulate: refused (...)" on
# purpose when a route must say no; the registry expects after it carry the assertion.
# Run on staging with NO other Legendary holder online or recorded (the ceiling counts are server-wide); it advances the
# era once. `ttl registry legendcap <max> <slots>` replaces max_holders / slots_per_era until `legendcap reset`.
# The Life 2 bots here are bots with the stage ttl.life2 (test hook). The hooks themselves (the fatal blow inside a pact, a
# real kill in a war, a combat log) need two real players and stay on the "verify in game" list; `ttl absorb simulate`
# runs the same code path (the route must be in force: a pact for duel and awakening, a war flag for war).
# `ttl absorb ep <p> <n>` fakes a bot's EP; `ttl absorb awake <p> lord|hero on|off` fakes a Tensura awakening flag.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotAbL
ttlbot spawn TtlBotAbM
ttlbot spawn TtlBotAbK
ttlbot spawn TtlBotAbV
ttlbot spawn TtlBotAbX
ttlbot spawn TtlBotAbY
@sleep 2
ttl registry legendcap 10 0
ttl era next

# ---- Legend pick ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AbL and AbM live a Legend life (boss + long play), die, wish for Strength (echo: Wrath) and choose Slime. The unique step
# then offers 3 drawn skills plus the Legendary echo. With the ceiling at 1 (the owner's Ten Great Demon Lords, cut down for
# the test) AbL takes the echo and AbM, the second Legend soul, is no longer offered it.
ttl karma TtlBotAbL set play_time 900000
ttl karma TtlBotAbL set mob_kills 800
ttl karma TtlBotAbL set far 6000
ttl karma TtlBotAbL set nether 1
ttl karma TtlBotAbL set end 1
ttl karma TtlBotAbL set ender_dragon 1
ttl karma TtlBotAbL set wither 1
ttl karma TtlBotAbL set trades 200
ttl karma TtlBotAbL set raids_won 2
ttl karma TtlBotAbL set deepslate_diamond_ore 60
ttl karma TtlBotAbL set ancient_debris 10
ttl karma TtlBotAbL set enchants 50
ttl karma TtlBotAbL set advancements 60
ttl karma TtlBotAbL expect tier legendary
ttl karma TtlBotAbM set play_time 900000
ttl karma TtlBotAbM set mob_kills 800
ttl karma TtlBotAbM set far 6000
ttl karma TtlBotAbM set nether 1
ttl karma TtlBotAbM set end 1
ttl karma TtlBotAbM set ender_dragon 1
ttl karma TtlBotAbM set wither 1
ttl karma TtlBotAbM set trades 200
ttl karma TtlBotAbM set raids_won 2
ttl karma TtlBotAbM set deepslate_diamond_ore 60
ttl karma TtlBotAbM set ancient_debris 10
ttl karma TtlBotAbM set enchants 50
ttl karma TtlBotAbM set advancements 60
ttl karma TtlBotAbM expect tier legendary
kill TtlBotAbL
kill TtlBotAbM
@sleep 1
ttl karma TtlBotAbL expect step wish
execute as TtlBotAbL run ttl wish strength
execute as TtlBotAbL run ttl choose slime
ttl karma TtlBotAbL expect step unique
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbL echo yes
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbL options 4
ttl registry legendcap 1 0
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbM echo no
execute as TtlBotAbL run ttl unique wrath
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbL wrath true
ttl registry expect holders 1
ttl era expect slots 1
ttl registry expect last TtlBotAbL grant wrath
execute as TtlBotAbM run ttl wish strength
execute as TtlBotAbM run ttl choose slime
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbM echo no
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbM options 3
# Room again (ceiling 10) but the per-era throttle is used up (1 slot, 1 used): still no echo for a Legend soul.
ttl registry legendcap 10 1
ttl era expect free 0
ttl reset TtlBotAbM
ttl registry legendcap 10 0
ttl reset TtlBotAbL
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbL wrath false

# ---- Absorption: the bots are Life 2 souls -------------------------------------------------------------------------
kubejs stages add TtlBotAbK ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotAbV ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotAbX ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotAbY ttl.life2
ttl absorb clear TtlBotAbK
ttl absorb clear TtlBotAbV
ttl absorb clear TtlBotAbX
ttl absorb clear TtlBotAbY
ttl absorb war clear
ttl grant TtlBotAbK predator
ttl grant TtlBotAbV great_sage
ttl grant TtlBotAbV berserker
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbK absorber yes
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbV absorber no
# Duel (consensual): no pact, no duel.
ttl absorb simulate TtlBotAbK TtlBotAbV duel
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbV great_sage true
execute as TtlBotAbK run ttl absorb duel TtlBotAbV
ttl absorb expect pacts 1
ttl absorb simulate TtlBotAbK TtlBotAbV duel
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbV great_sage true
execute as TtlBotAbV run ttl absorb accept TtlBotAbK
# EP gate: a victim under half the killer's EP is not worth absorbing; the duel is over all the same.
ttl absorb ep TtlBotAbK 1000
ttl absorb ep TtlBotAbV 100
ttl absorb simulate TtlBotAbK TtlBotAbV duel
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbV great_sage true
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbK great_sage false
ttl absorb expect pacts 0
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbK cooldown no
# Equal footing: the Legendary is stolen, the Rare is copied, the 72 h cooldown starts.
execute as TtlBotAbK run ttl absorb duel TtlBotAbV
execute as TtlBotAbV run ttl absorb accept TtlBotAbK
ttl absorb ep TtlBotAbV 800
ttl absorb simulate TtlBotAbK TtlBotAbV duel
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbK great_sage true
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbV great_sage false
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbK berserker true
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbV berserker true
ttl registry expect moved TtlBotAbV TtlBotAbK great_sage
ttl registry expect routed TtlBotAbK great_sage duel
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbK cooldown yes
# Cooldown: the next absorption is refused.
ttl grant TtlBotAbV envy
execute as TtlBotAbK run ttl absorb duel TtlBotAbV
execute as TtlBotAbV run ttl absorb accept TtlBotAbK
ttl absorb simulate TtlBotAbK TtlBotAbV duel
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbV envy true
# The winner needs an absorbing unique: V (none) beats K and takes nothing.
ttl absorb clear TtlBotAbK
execute as TtlBotAbV run ttl absorb duel TtlBotAbK
execute as TtlBotAbK run ttl absorb accept TtlBotAbV
ttl absorb simulate TtlBotAbV TtlBotAbK duel
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbK great_sage true
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbV cooldown no
ttl absorb clear TtlBotAbK
ttl absorb clear TtlBotAbV
# A declined duel leaves nothing open.
execute as TtlBotAbK run ttl absorb duel TtlBotAbV
execute as TtlBotAbV run ttl absorb decline TtlBotAbK
ttl absorb expect pacts 0

# War between nations: no EP gate, no absorber needed, Legendary only (a real death in game). A staff flag stands in for WP4.
ttl grant TtlBotAbX greed
ttl grant TtlBotAbX fighter
ttl absorb simulate TtlBotAbY TtlBotAbX war
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbX greed true
ttl absorb war TtlBotAbX TtlBotAbY
ttl absorb expect wars 1
ttl absorb ep TtlBotAbY 5
ttl absorb ep TtlBotAbX 9999
ttl absorb simulate TtlBotAbY TtlBotAbX war
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbY greed true
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbX greed false
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbY fighter false
ttl registry expect routed TtlBotAbY greed war
ttl absorb war clear
ttl absorb expect wars 0
ttl absorb clear TtlBotAbX
ttl absorb clear TtlBotAbY

# Bequest: the holder passes a unique on voluntarily; the receiver has to accept.
ttl grant TtlBotAbV analyst
execute as TtlBotAbV run ttl absorb bequest TtlBotAbK analyst
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbV analyst true
execute as TtlBotAbK run ttl absorb accept TtlBotAbV
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbK analyst true
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbV analyst false
ttl registry expect routed TtlBotAbK analyst bequest
# What you do not hold cannot be bequeathed.
execute as TtlBotAbV run ttl absorb bequest TtlBotAbK analyst
ttl absorb expect pacts 0

# Awakening: a True Hero claims a free Legendary of its kind, once; a True Demon Lord challenges a weaker holder.
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbY claimable 0
ttl absorb awake TtlBotAbY hero on
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbY kinds 1
execute as TtlBotAbY run ttl absorb claim wrath
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbY wrath false
execute as TtlBotAbY run ttl absorb claim creator
ttl registry expect holds TtlBotAbY creator true
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbY hero yes
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbY kinds 0
ttl absorb awake TtlBotAbY lord on
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbY kinds 1
ttl absorb ep TtlBotAbY 1000
ttl absorb ep TtlBotAbV 900
execute as TtlBotAbY run ttl absorb challenge TtlBotAbV
ttl absorb expect pacts 1
ttl absorb simulate TtlBotAbY TtlBotAbV awakening
ttl absorb expect pacts 0
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbY lord yes
ttl absorb expect TtlBotAbY cooldown yes

# Clean up: back to the shipped knobs; resets free every record.
ttl absorb war clear
ttl registry legendcap reset
ttl absorb clear TtlBotAbK
ttl absorb clear TtlBotAbV
ttl absorb clear TtlBotAbX
ttl absorb clear TtlBotAbY
ttl reset TtlBotAbK
ttl reset TtlBotAbV
ttl reset TtlBotAbX
ttl reset TtlBotAbY
kubejs stages remove TtlBotAbK ttl.life2
kubejs stages remove TtlBotAbV ttl.life2
kubejs stages remove TtlBotAbX ttl.life2
kubejs stages remove TtlBotAbY ttl.life2
ttlbot remove TtlBotAbL
ttlbot remove TtlBotAbM
ttlbot remove TtlBotAbK
ttlbot remove TtlBotAbV
ttlbot remove TtlBotAbX
ttlbot remove TtlBotAbY
